      "text": "View PDF",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "You can award the contract:",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "once the standstill period has elapsed with no challenge from unsuccessful tenderers",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "when you have obtained internal approvals your Organisation's governance requires.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Before awarding the contract to the successful tenderer(s) you should check the following.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Checklist",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "table",
      "text": "Action\tCompleted?\nHave you received the most up-to-date supporting documents referred to in the selection stage response e.g. certificates?\t\nWas the Standstill Notice sent to all bidders?\t\nWere there any concerned candidates? If so, was the Standstill Notice sent to them?\t\nHas the standstill period actually passed?\t\nWere any concerned candidates or bidders not notified electronically? If so a 15 days standstill applies.\t",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {
        "rows": [
          [
            "Action",
            "Completed?"
          ],
