          [
            "Were any concerned candidates or bidders not notified electronically? If so a 15 days standstill applies.",
            ""
          ]
        ],
        "row_count": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Action",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Completed?",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Have you received the most up-to-date supporting documents referred to in the selection stage response e.g. certificates?",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Was the Standstill Notice sent to all bidders?",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Were there any concerned candidates? If so, was the Standstill Notice sent to them?",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Has the standstill period actually passed?",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Were any concerned candidates or bidders not notified electronically? If so a 15 days standstill applies.",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Blank rows are provided for your use e.g. to add additional checklist items.",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Publishing the Contract Award",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Publishing the Contract Award"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The contract documentation should be collated and finalised to reflect the successful tenderer’s submission and agreed terms and conditions. This documentation must be signed in duplicate by the appropriate authority levels in both the contracting and tenderer's organisations.",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Publishing the Contract Award"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00018",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "You must include Fair Work practice commitments from the successful tenderer’s bid as standard Contract & Supplier Management criteria in the contract terms. This will include any agency or sub-contractor workers.",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Publishing the Contract Award"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00019",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "You must include terms which will apply to new members of the workforce during the delivery of the contract.",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Publishing the Contract Award"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00020",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "It is also important to include terms, which will apply to any new members to the workforce during the delivery of the contract.",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Publishing the Contract Award"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00021",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The documentation must be signed in duplicate by the appropriate authority levels in both the contracting and tenderer's organisations.",
      "ordinal": 21,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Publishing the Contract Award"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00022",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "You must consider who you need to inform when a contract has been awarded and the information they require e.g. notify stakeholders and users of the contract award, providing them with timescales, details of the contract, any migration considerations.",
      "ordinal": 22,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Publishing the Contract Award"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00023",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If using PCS-Tender , the Contract Award must be activated on the system. This activation does not generate correspondence to the tenderers. As a result you must issue the award on PCS .",
      "ordinal": 23,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Publishing the Contract Award"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00024",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Contract Award Notice",
      "ordinal": 24,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00025",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "A Contract Award Notice is a public announcement of the public procurement exercise outcome. This public announcement can be made in two ways:",
      "ordinal": 25,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00026",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "if your contract/Framework Agreement/Dynamic Purchasing System was advertised before 11 p.m. on 31 December your Contract Award Notices will be published via the Official Journal of the European Union (OJEU).",
      "ordinal": 26,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00027",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "if your contract/Framework Agreement/Dynamic Purchasing System was advertised after 11 p.m. on 31 December your Contract Award Notices will be published via the Find a Tender Service (FTS).",
      "ordinal": 27,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00028",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In both of the above scenarios PCS will automatically direct your Contract Award Notice via the correct publication system.",
      "ordinal": 28,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00029",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Publication of a Contract Award Notice is mandatory for ALL Route 3 procurement exercises.",
      "ordinal": 29,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00030",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The Contract Award Notice must be despatched no later than 30 calendar days after the contract or framework agreement award date. This also applies when a mini competition is £50k or over and has been called off from a Framework Agreement.",
      "ordinal": 30,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00031",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contract Award Notice(s) must be published on the Public Contracts Scotland (PCS) portal. Contract Award Notices published via PCS will contain all of the mandatory information required.",
      "ordinal": 31,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00032",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
      "ordinal": 32,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00033",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "When running a procurement exercise, there may be some circumstances where you wish to award some lots and not others.",
      "ordinal": 33,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00034",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "For example:",
      "ordinal": 34,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00035",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Delaying a contract award on a specific lot because of a delay to the standstill period but still awarding the other lots in the procurement exercise.",
      "ordinal": 35,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00036",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "There are no compliant bids on a specific lot and an alternative exercise may be required for this lot but the bids on the other lots are compliant and can still be awarded.",
      "ordinal": 36,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00037",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "To support this, in Public Contracts Scotland (PCS) , you will have the capability to award selected lots through separate award notices.",
      "ordinal": 37,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00038",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The process in PCS is:",
      "ordinal": 38,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00039",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Select your notice and c lick on “award”",
      "ordinal": 39,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00040",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "The new page will be displayed with all lots (if any). If there are no lots, the award process stays the same",
      "ordinal": 40,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00041",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "You will need to deselect lots you don’t want to award and then click “award”.",
      "ordinal": 41,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00042",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "There are no changes to the award notice itself and the award process will also stay the same.",
      "ordinal": 42,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00043",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Dynamic Purchasing System Contract Award Notices",
      "ordinal": 43,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "Dynamic Purchasing System Contract Award Notices"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00044",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "For contracts created via a Dynamic Purchasing System (DPS) , Contract Award Notices can either be:",
      "ordinal": 44,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "Dynamic Purchasing System Contract Award Notices"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00045",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "published individually for each and every award, or",
      "ordinal": 45,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "Dynamic Purchasing System Contract Award Notices"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00046",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "can be grouped together, published on a quarterly basis within 30 calendar days of the end of each quarter.",
      "ordinal": 46,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "Dynamic Purchasing System Contract Award Notices"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00047",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Contracts Register",
      "ordinal": 47,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "Contracts Register"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00048",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The Public Contract Scotland (PCS) Contracts Register module provides buying organisations a facility to operate a private register of all contracts they have in place, and a public register of these contracts to meet the obligations of the Procurement Reform Act (Scotland) 2014 .",
      "ordinal": 48,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "Contracts Register"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00049",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "When you publish a PCS award notice an entry is automatically made in your contracts register. Your organisation will need to make the decision whether to make the contracts register publicly viewable or not.",
      "ordinal": 49,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "Contracts Register"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00050",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The PCS contracts register will pull through the contract value from your contract award notice. You should always be as open and transparent as possible when completing this field. This field can be manually amended but all relevant amendments have to be manually duplicated in the Scottish Procurement Information Hub (there is no integration between the two systems for manual amendments).",
      "ordinal": 50,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "Contracts Register"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00051",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Even if you withhold the contract value from a contract award notice, this does not exempt the information being subsequently disclosed under the Freedom Of Information (Scotland) Act 2002 (FOISA) . To withhold information under FOISA, the information would have to, or be likely to, cause substantial prejudice. Also, the public interest in withholding the information would have to outweigh the public interest in its release.",
      "ordinal": 51,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "Contracts Register"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00052",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Detailed contracts register user guidance can be found in PCS .",
      "ordinal": 52,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "Contracts Register"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00053",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "PLEASE NOTE : if you do not use PCS for producing a contract register, you still must produce a publicly available one.",
      "ordinal": 53,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "Contracts Register"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00054",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Community Benefits",
      "ordinal": 54,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "Community Benefits"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00055",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The contract award notice must include a community benefits statement when:",
      "ordinal": 55,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "Community Benefits"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00056",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "the estimated value of the contract is equal to or greater than £4,000,000",
      "ordinal": 56,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "Community Benefits"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00057",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "the Procurement Documents stated community benefit requirements will be imposed in the contract,",
      "ordinal": 57,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "Community Benefits"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00058",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "the Procurement Documents stated community benefit requirements will be imposed in the contract,",
      "ordinal": 58,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "Community Benefits"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00059",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If included, this statement must include the benefits you believe will derive from community benefits clause(s) through the life of the contract.",
      "ordinal": 59,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "Community Benefits"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00060",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "With-holding Information",
      "ordinal": 60,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "With-holding Information"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00061",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "You can withhold information from the contract award notice or the conclusion of the framework agreement where publication:",
      "ordinal": 61,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "With-holding Information"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00062",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "a) would impede law enforcement;",
      "ordinal": 62,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "With-holding Information"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00063",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "b) would be against the public interest;",
      "ordinal": 63,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "With-holding Information"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00064",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "c) would affect the commercial interests of particular tenderer(s), whether they are public or private, or",
      "ordinal": 64,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "With-holding Information"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00065",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "d) may impact fair competition between tenderers",
      "ordinal": 65,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "With-holding Information"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00066",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Where the publication would affect the commercial interests of particular tenderers, you must demonstrate that the commercial interests of the company concerned would definitely be prejudiced by releasing the information.",
      "ordinal": 66,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "With-holding Information"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00067",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "As with all stages of the Procurement Journey c onsideration must also be given to Planning , Sustainable Procurement and Risk Management. For example you must be mindful that there is always a risk of supplier challenge to your procurement exercise. You must therefore do what you can to mitigate such risks.",
      "ordinal": 67,
      "heading_path": [
        "Pre-Contract Award Checklist",
        "Contract Award Notice",
        "Contract Award Notices for Lots",
        "With-holding Information"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    }
